{
  "format": "call-of-slop-recycling/1",
  "about": "The Recycler (docs/sandbox/CONSTRUCTS.md, 'Salvage haul'): what a wrecked part gives back by its mass and class. 'materials' are the bulk materials a bin can hold, in id order (the wire carries the index). A part's class is its role's entry in 'roles', else its 'material'. Units are whole numbers, at least 1 a part. 'kgPerUnit' is what a unit weighs in a bin: it counts in the construct's mass and centre of mass; a material not listed weighs 'defaultKgPerUnit'.",
